SUMMARY:Yosemite: Glacier Point Road typically opens
DESCRIPTION:Glacier Point Road usually opens in May once plowing is done\; 
 in 2026 it opened May 9. The park announces the date a few days ahead. Cha
 ins can still be required in the first weeks. Typical window\, not a publi
 shed date\; the park announces the day a few days ahead. Source: https://w
 ww.nps.gov/yose/planyourvisit/glacierpointroad.htm. Verified 2026-09-05. T
 he Talus Field\, https://thetalusfieldjournal.com/dates
